---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Journal"
description: "Semua catatan tentang web, desain, teknologi, dan proses."
permalink: /journal/
---
<main id="main" class="archive-page">
  <section class="wrap hero archive-hero">
    <div class="hero-top"><div class="eyebrow">THE WRITING ARCHIVE<br>ALL NOTES, IN ONE PLACE</div><div class="hero-year mono">{{ collections.posts.length }} ENTRIES</div></div>
    <h1>Journal<br><span class="second">& notes.</span></h1>
    <div class="hero-bottom"><div class="hero-caption">A RUNNING LOG<br>OF IDEAS & PROCESS.</div><p class="intro">Catatan yang dikumpulkan dari proses belajar, membangun, dan memperhatikan hal-hal kecil di dunia digital.</p></div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap section">
    <div class="section-label"><div><div class="eyebrow">01 / THE ARCHIVE</div><div class="name">All entries</div></div><div class="desc">Tulisan terbaru berada di bagian paling atas.</div><div class="count mono">{{ collections.posts.length }} ENTRIES</div></div>
    <div class="archive-list">
      {% for post in collections.posts %}
      <article class="archive-item">
        <span class="date">{{ post.date | shortDate }}</span>
        <div><h2><a href="{{ post.url | url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2><p>{{ post.data.description }}</p></div>
        <span class="archive-arrow">↗</span>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
</main>